  2. New: preserves_goto_to_label_in_outer_scope: build a HIR with [Label(1), While{ body: [If{then: [Goto(1)], 
  else: []}] }]. Assert the Goto(1) is retained after cleanup_unreachable_labels. This is the irreducible-loop
  pattern.
  3. New: preserves_goto_inside_if_inside_if: deeper-nested variant — [Label(1), If{then: [If{then: [Goto(1)], 
